# CCU.Alternative — 保守 .gitignore
# 原则：只入库自己写的源码和文档；构建产物、二进制、厂商派生文件一律排除。

# === 构建产物 ===
bin/
obj/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uildOutput/
publish/*
!publish/*.ps1
!publish/*.bat
!publish/*.md

# === 二进制 / 编译产物（含厂商 DLL 红线） ===
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.sys
*.cat
*.cer
*.lib
*.exp
*.bin
*.dat
*.cache
*.log
*.user
*.suo

# === 厂商派生材料（不可入库、不可二次分发） ===
M2Mqtt.Net.dll
decompiled/
*-installed-copy/
vendor/

# === 运行时产物 ===
*.runtimeconfig.json
*.deps.json

# === IDE ===
.vs/
.idea/
*.sln.docstates
